{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VXDAxzLnPCLWdPk9osyT6k","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines review form scoring rubric\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Review Form\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2025 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2025-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CommunityConnect 2025 Scoring Rubric for Abstracts 5 Excellent 4 Good 3 Fair 2\",\"url\":\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/9100a73e/files/uploaded/2025_Reviewer_Rating_Form_(Workshop_Rubric).pdf\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found information about CoRL 2025, but the specific details about reviewer guidelines, review form, and scoring rubric for CoRL 2025 were not fully available in the search results returned.\n\nThe most relevant information I found indicates that:\n\n- CoRL 2025 Conference uses OpenReview\n- The detailed review criteria information appears to be from CoRL 2024, which mentions that submissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical\n\nHowever, the specific reviewer guidelines, detailed review form, and scoring rubric for CoRL 2025 don't appear to be directly accessible in these search results. For the most current and complete information about CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines and scoring rubrics, I recommend:\n\n1. Visiting the CoRL 2025 OpenReview page directly at https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2025/Conference\n2. Checking the CoRL 2025 official website at www.corl.org\n3. Looking for any reviewer invitation emails which typically contain the complete review form and guidelines\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about any particular aspect of the CoRL review process?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93674eff-e87d-408e-ae27-8e2925426350","uuid":"d1df2544-7061-4a91-b112-97ed1b9179b8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:42:35.682Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines review form scoring rubric","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Dsc56grm2Yo9RcnxjjzBgL","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"Review Form","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform"},{"title":"ICLR 2025 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"2025 Reviewer Guidelines","url":"https://neurips.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuidelines"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CORL 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-