{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EgCfrJg7f9ezYZ4gJLhKFv","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 instruction for reviews reviewer form rating scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for Reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/frequently-asked-questions/\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the search results show general information about the review process and reviewer requirements rather than the specific rating scale details from the reviewer form. Let me search more specifically for the rating scale information.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/iclr-statistics/iclr-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"CORLcleared Vendor Scoring Process – CORL_Portal\",\"url\":\"https://corl-portal.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/14440881933339-CORLcleared-Vendor-Scoring-Process\"}]\n\nBased on my web search results, I found the official CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the search results don't show the complete detailed rating scale from the reviewer form. The search results indicate that results will be judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and/or their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning.\n\nThe search results show that reviewers are evaluated on various criteria and that papers receive numerical ratings, but the specific rating scale definitions used in the CoRL 2024 reviewer form are not fully displayed in the available search results. The examples from other conferences like ICML show they use scales like 1-10 with detailed descriptions, but I cannot confirm the exact rating scale used by CoRL 2024 from these results.\n\nTo access the complete and specific rating scale instructions for the CoRL 2024 reviewer form, I recommend visiting the official page directly at https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews, which should have the full details.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93674eff-e87d-408e-ae27-8e2925426350","uuid":"a39876c7-1c6a-4ece-8103-00927f463348","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:42:47.709Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 instruction for reviews reviewer form rating scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01KgMwUWc91RhXy4oLr98mJS","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/"},{"title":"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions","url":"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2024%2FConference"},{"title":"Instructions for Reviewers","url":"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/"},{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","url":"https://corl2022.org/frequently-asked-questions/"}]},"I found the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but the search results show general information about the review process and reviewer requirements rather than t