训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v5: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1762, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdZHiEHJYtcmeByPFEzNH4","session_id":"93674eff-e87d-408e-ae27-8e2925426350","uuid":"d8dafb23-455c-4770-ac56-96ae359c95fb","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:45:00.610Z"}
