{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QBNQxiidA4ezKuDjej9YTc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K4yV5ty7v6X1CJFLmu9Wbw","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"importance_margin_vla_compress","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3785,"cache_read_input_tokens":16659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3785,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdZHiEHJYtcmeByPFEzNH4","session_id":"93674eff-e87d-408e-ae27-8e2925426350","uuid":"6d28527c-fc02-46e4-bbab-ef555a2f3b90"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K4yV5ty7v6X1CJFLmu9Wbw","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — importance_margin_vla_compress\\\\n\\\\n## 关键教训\\\\n\\\\n### 🎯 MVP PASS: Two-stage 训练是解法 (2026-05-16, v8b_twostage)\\\\n**首个通过全部 MVP gate 的实验。**\\\\n- G1=93.23x, G2=+56.01pp, G3-deploy=0.8679 (**优于** baseline 13%), G4=0.1354\\\\n- ACIS+Prune(50%) action_loss = 0.003538 < baseline 0.004063\\\\n- 核心洞察：完全解耦 ACIS 和 backbone 训练后，ACIS pruning 不损害性能反而提升（正则化效应）\\\\n- 方案：Stage1 (0-10K) freeze backbone+LoRA 只训 ACIS (λ=1.0) → Stage2 (10K-30K) freeze ACIS 只训 LoRA\\\\n- 为什么 work：joint training 的根因是 backbone 和 ACIS 互相 co-adapt；two-stage 让 ACIS 先学 importance scoring（backbone 固定），再让 LoRA 适配固定的 ACIS routing pattern\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ LoRA + Flow Matching ODE = Mode Collapse (2026-05-16, sim eval)\\\\n**LoRA fine-tuning 破坏 flow matching 的 velocity field 全局结构，导致推理 mode collapse。**\\\\n- 预训练 action std=0.104, LoRA 模型 std=0.006（17x 衰减）\\\\n- 预训练 image sensitivity=0.149, LoRA 模型=0.024（6x 衰减，几乎忽略图像）\\\\n- 机制：LoRA (alpha=64, rank=32, scale=2.0) 在 flow field 中引入退化不动点，ODE solver 从纯 noise 出发所有轨迹收敛到同一常数 action\\\\n- forward() 不受影响（因 GT action 混入 noise），所以 offline action_loss 正常\\\\n- sample_actions() 完全失效 → closed-loop rollout 0% success\\\\n- **影响**：offline metrics (G1-G4) 仍然有效用于方法对比；success rate 需修复 LoRA 训练才能评估\\\\n- 候选修复：降低 alpha (64→16-32) / 加 generation loss / 减训练步数 / merge+full FT\\\\n\\\\n### λ sensitivity 在 gradient isolation 下反直觉 (2026-05-16, v8.1 negative)\\\\nv8 (λ=0.5, gradient isolation): G3-deploy = 1.344x\\\\nv8.1 (λ=0.2, gradient isolation): G3-deploy = 2.53x ← 降低 λ 恶化 G3\\\\n机理：低 λ=0.2 → ACIS 收敛慢 → 训练早期 routing 信号不稳定 → backbone 学到劣质表征且无法恢复。\\\\n\\\\n### AutoDL submit 命令必须含 network_turbo + WANDB_MODE (2026-05-16)\\\\n完整环境前缀：`source /etc/network_turbo && source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base && export HF_HOME=/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache && export REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE=/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt && export SSL_CERT_FILE=/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt && export WANDB_MODE=offline`\\\\nv8c 因缺 WANDB_MODE=offline 崩溃，加入标准模板。\\\\n\\\\n### G3 演进历史 (2026-05-15 → 2026-05-16)\\\\nv7 (joint, λ=0.5) 3.28x → v7.2 (joint, λ=0.2) 3.19x → v8 (grad isolation, λ=0.5) 1.344x → v8.1 (grad isolation, λ=0.2) 2.53x → **v8b (two-stage) 0.87x ✅**\\\\n���键转折点：从 gradient isolation（部分解耦）到 two-stage（完全解耦）\\\\n\\\\n### v8b two-stage 三层防护 (2026-05-16)\\\\nStage 2 (freeze ACIS, 只训 LoRA) 冻结策略：\\\\n1. freeze_params(acis_params) — requires_grad=False\\\\n2. gradient_isolation detach — action_loss ↛ ACIS, margin_loss ↛ LoRA\\\\n3. optimizer 只含 LoRA 参数\\\\n\\\\n### Eval bug 修复影响有限 (2026-05-16, D028)\\\\n5 项 evaluate.py bug 修复后，大多数指标变化 <5%。唯一显著变化是 G4 LED：0.169→0.087（降 49%）。\\\\n\\\\n### ACIS 的正则化效应 (2026-05-16)\\\\n在 two-stage 模型中最为显著：ACIS+Prune(50%) loss 0.003538 < baseline 0.004063 < random prune 0.018。\\\\n说明 ACIS 学到了真正的 importance ranking，移除低重要性 token 不仅不伤性能，还消除噪声/干扰。\\\\n\\\\n### Gate Criteria (D026 最终版, 2026-05-16)\\\\n- G1: IMM margin median / baseline margin median ≥ 2.0x\\\\n- G2: IMM preservation - baseline preservation ≥ +10pp (eps=0.01)\\\\n- **G3-deploy (MVP 主 gate)**: ACIS+Prune(50%) action_loss / baseline action_loss ≤ 1.10x\\\\n- G4: IMM LED median < 1.0\\\\n\\\\n### Checkpoint 路径命名\\\\n- v8: checkpoints/imm_anchor_v8/\\\\n- v8.1: checkpoints/imm_anchor_v8_1/\\\\n- v8b (MVP PASS): checkpoints/imm_two_stage/final/checkpoint.pt\\\\n- v8c (annealing): checkpoints/imm_anchor_v8c_annealing/\\\\n\\\\n## 环境信息\\\\n- 服务器: westd-27271, 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB\\\\n- conda: source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base\\\\n- 项目路径: /root/autodl-tmp/importance_margin_vla_compress\\\\n- Eval results: /root/autodl-tmp/importance_margin_vla_compress/eval_results/\\\\n- AutoDL 网络: source /etc/network_turbo（HF 操作前必须执行）\\\\n- WANDB: export WANDB_MODE=offline（避免 login 错误）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3488, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdZHiEHJYtcmeByPFEzNH4","session_id":"93674eff-e87d-408e-ae27-8e2925426350","uuid":"bd8eee0c-9db3-4dac-9bcc-b5df95579524","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:45:06.135Z"}
